<Layout title="About"><section class="reading page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">About the publication</p><h1>Space for independent thought.</h1><div class="prose"><p>Independent Research is a research and editorial platform exploring strategic design, artificial intelligence, design systems, and organizational transformation.</p><p>Research provides space for sustained inquiry. Writing offers essays and reflections on ideas in practice.</p><h2>Editorial approach</h2><p>Work published here should distinguish evidence from interpretation, acknowledge uncertainty, and make its sources clear. AI assistance does not replace author judgment or source verification.</p></div></section></Layout>
